.vercel

# Visual parity artefacts.
# target/ and diffs/ are regenerable per-run, never committed.
# production/ baseline (~400MB of PNGs + DOM snapshots) is regenerable via
#   `tsx tools/visual-parity/capture-production.ts --baseline-dir sites/colossus-scaffolding/tests/visual-baseline`
# Not committed; consider git-lfs or a separate baseline storage bucket before enabling CI.
# The manifest.json IS tracked (it's small and defines which routes the gate covers).
tests/visual-baseline/target/
tests/visual-baseline/diffs/
tests/visual-baseline/production/
